    "options": {
      "A": "The angle is reflex, because $180^{\\circ} < 210^{\\circ} < 360^{\\circ}$.",
      "B": "The angle is obtuse, because it is greater than $90^{\\circ}$.",
      "C": "The angle is acute, because $210$ is the only printed size on the diagram.",
      "D": "The angle is right, by treating a corner mark as $90^{\\circ}$ no matter what size is labelled."
    },
